    ":question/problem": "Calculate $det(R)$ given that\n$R=\\begin{bmatrix}8 & -5 \\\\ 3 & 4\\end{bmatrix}.$\n\n$det(R)=$\n{{field-1}}",
    ":question/worked-solution": "For a $2\\times 2$ matrix, the determinant is given by the formula\n\n$$\n|\\begin{aligned}a & b \\\\ c & d\\end{aligned}|=ad-bc.\n$$\n\nUsing the formula, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}det(R) & =|\\begin{aligned}8 & -5 \\\\ 3 & 4\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =(8)(4)-(-5)(3) \\\\  & =32+15 \\\\  & =47.\\end{aligned}\n$$"
  },
