    ":question/problem": "$\\begin{vmatrix}6 & 3 \\\\ 2 & 1\\end{vmatrix}=$",
    ":question/worked-solution": "For a $2\\times 2$ matrix, the determinant is given by the formula\n\n$$\n\\begin{vmatrix}a & b \\\\ c & d\\end{vmatrix}=ad-bc.\n$$\n\nUsing the formula, we have:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\begin{vmatrix}6 & 3 \\\\ 2 & 1\\end{vmatrix} & =6\\cdot 1-3\\cdot 2 \\\\  & =6-6 \\\\  & =0\\end{aligned}\n$$"
